&lt;h2&gt;About Us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At &lt;a href=&quot;http://prenuvo.com/&quot;&gt;Prenuvo&lt;/a&gt;, we are on a mission to flip the paradigm from reactive “sick-care” to proactive healthcare. Our award-winning whole-body scan is fast (under 1 hour), safe (MRI has no ionizing radiation), and non-invasive (no contrast). Our unique integrated stack of optimized hardware, software, and increasingly AI, coupled with the patient-centric experience of our clinics across North America, has allowed us to lead the charge against “we caught it too late again.”&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re building our talent community for future MRI Technologist opportunities across our global clinics.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While we may not have an immediate opening at this time, we’re interested in connecting with talented MRI Technologists who are passionate about delivering exceptional patient care and would like to be considered for future opportunities with our team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Future opportunities are expected to be &lt;strong&gt;on-site and permanent&lt;/strong&gt;, with clinic operating hours based on demand and operational needs. Successful candidates should be within a reasonable commuting distance of the clinic.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Help reshape the world through proactive healthcare while working with cutting-edge technology and high-performing teams with deep expertise. Join our talent community and be considered for future opportunities to make a difference in people’s lives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Not Your Average Technologist Job&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive wages and solid benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A focus on merit, meaningful work, and job satisfaction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;More flexibility and consistency in your schedule, with no on-call requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perks and benefits more commonly associated with tech companies versus traditional medical practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A positive, collaborative environment where we embrace proactive healthcare&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to top-of-the-line MRI equipment and industry-leading protocols&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A safe working environment for both staff and patients, with no walk-in guests and no breaking skin&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You Could Do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operate MRI Scanners:&lt;/strong&gt; Ensure patient safety and perform high-quality Prenuvo scans while remaining current on Prenuvo scan protocols&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clinic &amp;amp; Equipment Preparation:&lt;/strong&gt; Order supplies, clean equipment, and prepare the scan room&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Troubleshooting:&lt;/strong&gt; Identify and report equipment issues to the appropriate department when necessary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technology &amp;amp; Systems:&lt;/strong&gt; Utilize ancillary tools and equipment appropriately, including PACS and other software systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Image Post-Processing:&lt;/strong&gt; Complete post-processing requirements, including transferring images to PACS and ensuring all steps are completed accurately&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership &amp;amp; Training:&lt;/strong&gt; Support the training and development of new technologists across patient safety, room preparation, communication, image acquisition, time management, and post-processing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong foundational knowledge of MRI imaging and patient safety&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Licensed with the appropriate board: ARMRIT or ARRT (MR), or equivalent depending on location&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BLS (Basic Life Support) certification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Completion of an accredited MRI or radiologic technology program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 2 years of clinical work experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to independently perform and accurately complete MRI examinations in accordance with clinic practices and procedures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency running advanced MR studies independently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work effectively with a multidisciplinary team in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong patient care skills, including the ability to explain complex medical terms and procedures in an easy-to-understand manner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to learn new skills and adapt to new protocols and technology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong interpersonal, verbal, and written communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer-focused attitude and professional presentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pride in your work and ability to critically assess image quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Our Values&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;First: we are Pioneers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Transforming healthcare requires divergent thinking, bias for action, disciplined experimentation, and consistent grit and determination to maintain momentum. This journey is as challenging as it is rewarding.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Second: we are Platform-Builders&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re always building foundations that allow us to achieve tomorrow more than we did today. We never lose sight of what’s ahead, with a mindset of ownership and duty to our mission.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Above all: we are Patients&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We could all be the next person who walks through our doors, seeking clarity or peace of mind. We are proud of our impact on our patients’ lives, and we won’t stop until everyone can benefit from our work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What We Offer&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An opportunity to make a positive impact on people’s lives and their health&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free whole-body scans for every Prenuvo team member&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Growth opportunities at the heart of our people journey, with no single path to success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong focus on building relationships, with opportunities for our team to connect, share, and socialize&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A flexible vacation policy that encourages time away to recharge&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prenuvo’s Commuter Benefits Plan to help cover eligible transit and parking costs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A 401(k) plan for U.S. employees, with company contributions to support your financial goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A comprehensive benefits package including health, dental, vision, and mental health coverage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are an equal-opportunity employer and value diversity at our company. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, color, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, marital status, veteran status, or disability status.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;As part of the hiring process, successful candidates will undergo a background check in compliance to applicable federal, provincial, and state rules.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please be advised that official communication from our recruitment team will only come from our authorized domain [&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://prenuvo.com/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;prenuvo.com&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;]. If you are contacted by a recruiter, please ensure their email address ends with @prenuvo.com. We do not use third-party recruitment services or any other email domains for hiring purposes. If you receive communication that you believe to be fraudulent, please report it immediately to jobs@prenuvo.com.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
